# ai-dotfiles/.gitignore
# FR-11: keys/ and *.local.env MUST never be tracked.
keys/
*.local.env

# RES (Research / Spike / POC) lane — transient artifacts under sandbox.
# Per IMP-20260514-research-lane FR-10: notebook checkpoints, dataset
# dumps, scratch outputs in `research/<spec-id>/.tmp/` MUST NOT be committed.
research/*/.tmp/
research/**/.tmp/

**/skills/.system/*
**/skills/.system/.*

# Per-profile tool subdirs are entirely machine-generated by
# scripts/lib/profile-links.sh (run via `make profile-init` / `ai <profile>`):
# framework wiring symlinks with absolute, host-specific targets, plus
# shared tool-home state linked in by ai-switch. None of it is portable or
# version-controllable — regenerate it, never commit it. Only the
# hand-authored profile.env and preferences.md (at the profile root) are
# tracked.
profiles/*/claude/
profiles/*/copilot/
profiles/*/codex/
